{"charCount": 47, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 1, "hanjaCount": 35, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_1-01", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 1면 1번째 줄", "missingCount": 6, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "惟昔始祖,鄒牟王之創基也,出自北夫餘,天帝之子,母河伯女郎，剖卵降出生子,有聖□□□□□□命駕", "transcriptLine": 1, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 47, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 1, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_1-02", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 1면 2번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "巡車南下，路由夫餘奄利大水。王臨津言曰我是皇天之子，母河伯女郎，鄒牟王。為我連葭！浮龜應聲即為", "transcriptLine": 2, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 47, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 1, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_1-03", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 1면 3번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "連葭。浮龜然後造渡於沸流，穀忽本西城山上，而建都焉永樂世位，因遣黃龍來下迎王，王於忽本東岡，黃", "transcriptLine": 3, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 46, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 1, "hanjaCount": 40, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_1-04", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 1면 4번째 줄", "missingCount": 1, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "龍負昇天。顧命世子儒留王，以道興治大朱，留王紹承基業。□至十七世孫國岡上廣開土境平安好太王。", "transcriptLine": 4, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 49, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 1, "hanjaCount": 39, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_1-05", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 1면 5번째 줄", "missingCount": 2, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "二九登祚，號為永樂太王，恩澤洽於皇天，威武柳被四海。掃除□□，庶寧其業。國富民殷，五穀豊熟，昊天不", "transcriptLine": 5, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 44, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 1, "hanjaCount": 39, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_1-06", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 1면 6번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "弔，卅有九晏駕棄國。以甲寅年九月廿九日乙酉遷就山陵於是立碑銘記勳績，以永後世。焉其辭曰：", "transcriptLine": 6, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 47, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 1, "hanjaCount": 40, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_1-07", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 1면 7번째 줄", "missingCount": 1, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "永樂五年，歲在乙未，王以碑麗不息，□人躬率往討。過富山負山至鹽水，上破其丘部洛六七百當，牛馬群", "transcriptLine": 7, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 50, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 1, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_1-08", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 1면 8번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "羊不可稱數。於是旋駕，因過襄平道，東來候城、力城、北豊、五備。海遊觀土境，田獵而還。百殘新羅舊是屬民", "transcriptLine": 8, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 148, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": ["或解作\"每\"字"], "face": 1, "hanjaCount": 109, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_1-09", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 1면 9번째 줄", "missingCount": 13, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "由來朝貢，而倭以辛卯年來渡海破百殘，□□新羅以為臣民。以六年丙申，王躬率水軍討科殘國軍□□。首攻取壹八城、臼模盧城、各模盧城、幹?利城、□□城、閣彌城、牟盧城彌沙城、□舍鳥城、阿旦城、古利城、□利城、雜彌城奧利城、勾牟城、古模耶羅城、頁□城、□□城、分而能羅城場城、於利城、農賣城、豆奴城、沸□□", "transcriptLine": 9, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 52, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 2, "hanjaCount": 37, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_2-01", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 2면 1번째 줄", "missingCount": 4, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "利城、彌鄒城、也利城、大山韓城、掃加城敦拔城、□□□城、婁實城、散那城、□婁城細城、牟婁城、弓婁城、蘇灰", "transcriptLine": 1, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 54, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 2, "hanjaCount": 35, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_2-02", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 2면 2번째 줄", "missingCount": 6, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "城、燕婁城、柝支利城、巖門至城、林城、□□城、□□城、□利城、就鄒城、□拔城、古牟婁城、閨奴城、貫奴城、豐穰", "transcriptLine": 2, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 48, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 2, "hanjaCount": 32, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_2-03", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 2면 3번째 줄", "missingCount": 8, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "城、□城、儒□羅城、仇天城、□□□□□其國城。賊不服氣，敢出百戰。王威赫怒渡阿利水遣刺迫城，橫□", "transcriptLine": 3, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 48, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 2, "hanjaCount": 40, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_2-04", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 2면 4번째 줄", "missingCount": 1, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "侵穴□便國城。百殘王困，逼獻出男女生白一千人，細布千匝，歸王自誓，從今以後，永為奴客。太王恩赦先", "transcriptLine": 4, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 48, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 2, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_2-05", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 2면 5번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "迷之御，錄其後順之誠。於是得五十八城、村七百。將殘王弟並大臣十人，旋師還都。八年戊戌，教遣偏師觀", "transcriptLine": 5, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 45, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 2, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_2-06", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 2면 6번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "帛慎土谷。因便抄得莫新羅城加太羅谷男女三百餘人，自此以來朝貢論事。九年己亥，百殘違誓與倭和", "transcriptLine": 6, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 49, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 2, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_2-07", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 2면 7번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "通。王巡下平穰，而新羅遣使白王云，倭人滿其國境，潰破城池，以奴客為民，歸王請命。太王恩後稱其忠誠，", "transcriptLine": 7, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 49, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 2, "hanjaCount": 40, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_2-08", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 2면 8번째 줄", "missingCount": 1, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "時遣使還，告以□訴。十年庚子，教遣步騎五萬，往救新羅，從男居城至新羅城，倭滿其中。官兵方至，倭賊退", "transcriptLine": 8, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 64, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 2, "hanjaCount": 32, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_2-09", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 2면 9번째 줄", "missingCount": 25, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "□□□□□□□□來背息，追至任那加羅，從拔城，城即歸服。安羅人戍兵拔新羅城，□城。倭滿，倭潰城大□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□", "transcriptLine": 9, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 25, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 2, "hanjaCount": 13, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_2-10", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 2면 10번째 줄", "missingCount": 12, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "□九盡臣有尖安羅人戍兵滿□□□□其□□□□□□□言", "transcriptLine": 10, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 41, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 3, "hanjaCount": 2, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_3-01", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 3면 1번째 줄", "missingCount": 39, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□□辭□□□□□□□□□□□□□潰", "transcriptLine": 1, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 44, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 3, "hanjaCount": 32, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_3-02", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 3면 2번째 줄", "missingCount": 9, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "□以隨□。安羅人戍兵昔新羅，安錦未有身來朝貢□。國岡上廣開土境好太王□□□□寐錦□□僕句", "transcriptLine": 2, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 44, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 3, "hanjaCount": 26, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_3-03", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 3면 3번째 줄", "missingCount": 15, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "□□□□朝貢。十四年甲辰而倭不軌，侵入帶方界□□□□□，石城□連船□□□王躬率□□從平穰", "transcriptLine": 3, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 47, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 3, "hanjaCount": 29, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_3-04", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 3면 4번째 줄", "missingCount": 12, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "□□□鋒相遇，王幢要截盪刺，倭寇潰敗，斬殺無數。十七年丁未，教遣步騎五萬，□□□□□□□□□城", "transcriptLine": 4, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 47, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 3, "hanjaCount": 33, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_3-05", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 3면 5번째 줄", "missingCount": 8, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "□□合戰，斬殺湯盡所稚鎧鉀一萬餘，領軍資器械不可勝數。還破沙溝城、婁城、還住城、□□□□□□那", "transcriptLine": 5, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 46, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 3, "hanjaCount": 34, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_3-06", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 3면 6번째 줄", "missingCount": 7, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "□城。廿年庚戌，東夫餘舊是鄒牟王屬民中叛不貢，王躬率往討，軍到餘城，而餘城國駢□□□□□□那", "transcriptLine": 6, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 43, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 3, "hanjaCount": 35, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_3-07", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 3면 7번째 줄", "missingCount": 6, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "□□王恩晉虛。於是旋還。又其慕化隨官來者味仇婁鴨盧卑斯麻鴨盧□立婁鴨盧肅斯舍鴨盧□□□", "transcriptLine": 7, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 44, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 3, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_3-08", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 3면 8번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "鴨盧。凡所攻破城六十四村，一千四百守墓人煙戶賣勾余民國煙。二看煙三東海賈國煙三看煙五敦城", "transcriptLine": 8, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 47, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 3, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_3-09", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 3면 9번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "民四家盡為看煙。于城一家為看煙碑，利城二家為國煙，平穰城民國煙。一看煙十呰，連二家為看煙，住婁", "transcriptLine": 9, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 46, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 3, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_3-10", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 3면 10번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "人國煙一看煙卌二，溪谷二家為看煙。梁城二家為看煙，安失連廿二家為看煙，改谷三家為看煙，新城三", "transcriptLine": 10, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 45, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 3, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_3-11", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 3면 11번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "家為看煙，南蘇城一家為國煙。新來韓穢沙水城國煙一看煙，一牟婁城二家為看煙，豆比鴨岑韓五家為", "transcriptLine": 11, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 46, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 3, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_3-12", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 3면 12번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "看煙，勾牟客頭二家為看煙，永底韓一家為看煙，舍蔦城韓穢國煙。三看煙廿一古家耶羅城一家為看煙，", "transcriptLine": 12, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 45, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 3, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_3-13", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 3면 13번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "炅古城國煙。一看煙三客賢韓一家為看煙，阿旦城雜珍城合十家為看煙，巴奴城韓九家為看煙，各模廬", "transcriptLine": 13, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 50, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 3, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_3-14", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 3면 14번째 줄", "missingCount": 4, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "城四家為看煙，各模盧城二家為看煙，牟水城三家為看煙，幹弓利城國煙。二看煙三彌舊城國煙。七看煙□□□□", "transcriptLine": 14, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 41, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 4, "hanjaCount": 37, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_4-01", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 4면 1번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "七也利城三家為看煙，豆奴城國煙。一看煙二奧利城國煙。二看煙八須鄒城國煙。二看煙五百", "transcriptLine": 1, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 44, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 4, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_4-02", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 4면 2번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "殘南居韓國煙。一看煙五大山韓城六家為看煙農賣城國姻。一看煙一閏奴城國煙。二都煙廿二古牟婁", "transcriptLine": 2, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 46, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 4, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_4-03", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 4면 3번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "城國煙。二看煙八琢城國煙。一看煙八味城六家為看煙，就咨城五家為看煙，豐穰城廿四家為看煙，散那", "transcriptLine": 3, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 46, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 4, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_4-04", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 4면 4번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "城一家為國煙。那旦城一家為看煙，勾牟城一家為看煙，於利城八家為看煙，比利城三家為看煙，細城三", "transcriptLine": 4, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 45, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 4, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_4-05", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 4면 5번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "家為看煙。國岡上廣開土境好太王存時教言，祖王先王但教取遠近舊民守墓洒掃，吾慮舊民轉當嬴劣。", "transcriptLine": 5, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 47, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 4, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_4-06", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 4면 6번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "若吾萬年之後，安守墓者。但取吾躬率所略來韓穢，令備洒掃言教如此，是以如教令。取韓穢二百廿家，慮", "transcriptLine": 6, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 46, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 4, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_4-07", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 4면 7번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "其不知法則，復取舊民一百十家，合新舊守墓石國煙，卅看煙三百都合三百卅家。自上祖先王以來，墓上", "transcriptLine": 7, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 46, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 4, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_4-08", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 4면 8번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "不安石碑，致使守墓人煙戶差錯。惟國岡上廣開土境好太王，盡為祖先王墓上立碑，銘其煙戶不令差錯。", "transcriptLine": 8, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"charCount": 45, "chunkType": "line", "editorNotes": [], "face": 4, "hanjaCount": 41, "id": "chunk_gwanggaeto_4-09", "lang": "hanmun", "locator": "전사본 4면 9번째 줄", "missingCount": 0, "sourceId": "src-gwanggaeto", "text": "又制守墓人自今以後不得更相轉賣，雖有富足之者亦不得檀買，其有違令賣者刑之買人，制令守墓之。", "transcriptLine": 9, "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
